summary:
funny thing: the almanack of naval wasn't written by
@naval
. the book of elon wasn't written by
@elonmusk
. same author, completely different energy.
the line that hit me hardest:
"physics discovers what already exists. engineering creates what has never existed before."
thank you
@naval
 and
@elonmusk
 for thinking out loud all these years. and thank you
@EricJorgenson
 for turning that noise into signal.

